{
  "title": "95: al-Teen التين",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "بِسْمِ اللهِ الرَّحْمٰنِ الرَّحِيْمِ\nBISMIL LAAHIR RAHMAANIR RAHEEM\nIn the Name of Allah, the All-beneficent, the All-merciful\nوَالتِّيْنِ وَالزَّيْتُوْنِۙ‏(1)\nWAT TEENE WAZ ZAYTOONE.\nBy the Fig and the Olive!\nوَطُوْرِ سِيْنِيْنَۙ‏(2)\nWA TOORE SEENEENA\nBy the Mount Sinai!\nوَهٰذَا الْبَلَدِ الْاَمِيْنِۙ‏(3)\nWA HAAZAL BALADIL AMEENE.\nAnd by this City (declared) Inviolate!\nلَقَدْ خَلَقْنَا الْاِنْسَانَ فِىْۤ اَحْسَنِ تَقْوِيْمٍ‏(4)\nLAQAD KHALAQNAL INSAANA FEE AHSANE TAQWEEM.\nIndeed, We created man in the best structure\nثُمَّ رَدَدْنٰهُ اَسْفَلَ سَافِلِيْنَۙ‏(5)\nSUMMA RADADNAAHO ASFALA SAAFELEENA.\nThen We reverted him to the lowest of the low\nاِلَّا الَّذِيْنَ اٰمَنُوْا وَعَمِلُوا الصّٰلِحٰتِ فَلَهُمْ اَجْرٌ غَيْرُ مَمْنُوْنٍؕ‏(6)\nILLAL LAZEENA AAMANOO WA A’MELUS SAALEHAATE FA-LAHUM AJRUN GHAYRO MAMNOON.\nSave those who believe and do good deeds, for them shall be a recompense incessant\nفَمَا يُكَذِّبُكَ بَعْدُ بِالدِّيْنِ‏(7)\nFAMAA YOKAZZEBOKA BA’DO BID-DEEN.\n(O’ Man!) What then can make thee belie after this the Final Judgment?\nاَلَيْسَ اللّٰهُ بِاَحْكَمِ الْحٰكِمِيْنَ‏(8)\nA LAYSAL LAAHO BE-AHKAMIL HAAKEMEEN.\nWhat! Is not God the Judge of the judges?",
  "merits": "This Surah was revealed in Makkah and has 8 verses. Imam Ja’far as-Sadiq (a.s.) has said the reward for reciting this Surah in prayers is a great palace in Jannah.\nIt is narrated from the Holy Prophet (s.a.w.a.) that the reward given to the person who recites this Surah cannot be counted. If recited on food, its evil effects are removed. The one who recites this Surah is compared to the person who has visited the Holy Prophet (s.a.w.a.) and had his needs fulfilled by him."
